msgstr "Asset-Skript"

#: ../../04_building-apps/07_smart-contracts-overview.md:9
msgid "Attached to"
msgstr "Beigefügt an"

#: ../../04_building-apps/07_smart-contracts-overview.md:9
msgid "An account, which becomes a dApp"
msgstr "Ein Konto, das zu einem dApp wird"

#: ../../04_building-apps/07_smart-contracts-overview.md:9
msgid "An account, which becomes a smart account"
msgstr "Ein Konto, das zu einem Smart Account wird"

#: ../../04_building-apps/07_smart-contracts-overview.md:9
msgid "A token, which becomes a smart asset"
