#: ../../04_building-apps/07_smart-contracts-overview.md:9
msgid "[Creating and Launching a dApp](08_creating-and-launching-a-dapp)"
msgstr "[Erstellen und Starten eines dApp](08_creating-and-launching-a-dapp)"

#: ../../04_building-apps/07_smart-contracts-overview.md:9
